        P("Microscopy gives a fast first look: a rapid preliminary or final ID, more than one organism in a sample, organisms that are hard to culture, the quality of the specimen, and a guide to which tests to run next. Types include <b>light microscopy</b>, <b>fluorescence microscopy</b>, dark field and electron microscopy."),
        P("The <b>Gram stain</b> sorts bacteria by their cell wall in four steps:"),
